'''Nutcracker Witch''' (くるみ割りの魔女, ''Kurumiwari no Majo'', '''Nutcracker Witch''') is a [[:Category:Witch Enemies|Witch]] enemy that appears in the [[Puella Magi Madoka Magica Collaboration Event]]. She was added in [[Version 7.4 Update|Version 7.4]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Nutcracker Witch
|image = E 429.png
|appearance = [[Puella Magi Madoka Magica Collaboration Event]]
|money drop = 9,000¢ - 35,550¢
}}

==Enemy==
Nutcracker Witch is an incredibly tough enemy, with 9 million health, exceptional range, [[Base Destroyer]] and immunity to most effects. Because of her [[Omni Strike]], she only needs to get within 1,800 range of the [[Cat Base]] to damage it and, with Base Destroyer, she deals 48,000 damage per hit. The worst thing she has going for her is her [[Weaken|weaken]] ability, which for any cat not immune to weaken effectively doubles her health to ''18 million''.

==Strategy==
The best way to defeat her is with [[Li'l Madoka (Rare Cat)|Li'l Madoka]]'s and [[Li'l Homura (Special Cat)|Li'l Homura]]'s [[Cat Combo|Combo]], [[My Very Best Friend (Combo)|My Very Best Friend]], combined with [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rares]] from the collab like [[Kyoko Sakura (Uber Rare Cat)|Kyoko Sakura]]. If such Ubers are not available, others like [[Lesser Demon Cat (Uber Rare Cat)|Balrog Cat]] can also be very effective.

Her DPS is not the best, so tankers like [[Titan Cat (Normal Cat)|Jamiera]] and [[Kai (Uber Rare Cat)|Kai]] are great for walking up and dealing damage. Your attackers should also ideally have weaken/knockback immunity as well.

