==Trivia==
*Nutcracker Witch has the highest health out of all enemies at 100% strength magnification.
*Nutcracker Witch is tied with [[Walpurgisnacht (Enemy)|Walpurgisnacht]] for the 2nd place of most abilities out of all enemies. The only other enemies with more abilities are [[Bears Be Back]] and [[Unit-13's False Evolution]], both of which are also tied.
*Incidentally, [[Yuru-i GeGeGe no Kitarou: Youkai Dotabata Daisensou|YuruGeGe]]'s Traitless Enemy, [[wikia:gegegenokitaro:Nurarihyon|Nurarihyon]]'s rebirthed form, Nurari-Kanibozu has similar attack mechanism without low KB rate.
*Prior to [[Version 14.1 Update|Version 14.1]], Nutcracker Witch's name was Homulilly.

